    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story 210</strong> is a psychological horror game where you experience the story from the perspective of a married man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788190/extras/b3f40cd62ed19491577cb6441f75926d.poster.avif?t=1755653231\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788190/extras/b3f40cd62ed19491577cb6441f75926d.webm?t=1755653231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788190/extras/b3f40cd62ed19491577cb6441f75926d.mp4?t=1755653231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story 210</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Story 210</i>, you arrive home and notice that something terrible has happened to your wife \u2014 and you'll live through what comes after.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Story 210</i> is a photo-realistic first-person simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and photo realistic graphics.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story 210</strong> is a psychological horror game where you experience the story from the perspective of a married man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788190/extras/b3f40cd62ed19491577cb6441f75926d.poster.avif?t=1755653231\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788190/extras/b3f40cd62ed19491577cb6441f75926d.webm?t=1755653231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788190/extras/b3f40cd62ed19491577cb6441f75926d.mp4?t=1755653231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story 210</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Story 210</i>, you arrive home and notice that something terrible has happened to your wife \u2014 and you'll live through what comes after.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Story 210</i> is a photo-realistic first-person simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and photo realistic graphics.</p></li></ul>",
